    - '// @ui {"widget":"label", "label":"<span style=\"color: #60A5FA;\">Aspect Ratio</span>"}'
    - "// @ui {\"widget\":\"label\", \"label\":\"<span style=\\\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\\\">Width ÷ height. When active and the main axis is auto (flex-basis auto, no grow/shrink), the item derives its main size from its resolved cross size to hold this ratio. 0 = inherit content (e.g. an Image's texture aspect), -1 = disabled, &gt;0 = explicit.</span>\"}"
    - '// @input float _aspectRatio {"label":"Aspect Ratio", "hint":"Width / height. 0 = inherit content (e.g. Image texture), -1 = disabled, >0 = explicit ratio."}'
